IDD_HO_SESSION DIALOGEX 0, 0, 340, 273
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_FIXEDSYS | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU | WS_MINIMIZEBOX | WS_CLIPCHILDREN
